Resolving a name

The `Laptop` asks the `Resolver`. The `Resolver` asks the `Root server`, then
the `TLD server`, then the `Authoritative server`. Each of the three answers
the `Resolver` with the label `referral`.
---
Laptop -> Resolver: ask
Resolver -> Root server, TLD server, Authoritative server: ask
Root server, TLD server, Authoritative server -> Resolver: referral
